        <mxCell id="panel" value="&lt;b&gt;Entscheidungen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Erreichbarkeit: &lt;b&gt;private&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Netzwerk: reference&lt;br&gt;Vorgaben: BSI C5&lt;br&gt;Private DNS: platform&lt;br&gt;Diagnose: log-platform-prod-we (rg-observability-prod-we)&lt;br&gt;VNet: vnet-hub-prod-we (rg-network-prod-we)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;Offen&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which subscriptions do the development and test stages deploy into? The request named production&amp;apos;s; the stack is one subscription per stage.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which resource group does each of the other stages deploy into?&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which hub network do the development and test stages attach to?&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which subnet carries the private endpoints in the development and test hubs?&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which workspace receives the development and test stages&amp;apos; diagnostics?&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Follows deployment.private_endpoint_subnet per stage.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Follows deployment.diagnostics_destination per stage.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: platform team)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which tag set does the organisation apply? Nothing in the request, no repository to read it from.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: workload owner)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&apos;#D13438&apos;&gt;• Which principal reads and writes the invoices, and which data-plane role does it need? Shared-key auth is off, so an account with no assignment is working as specified and unusable.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;(zuständig: workload owner)&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#F3F2F1;strokeColor=#C8C6C4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
